{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"The papers of the hawker lie in the dust, their headlines constituting a chaos of trains and thefts that do not touch the bone-deep hunger of my own particular existence. I possess six rupees, a sum so trivial that it is almost an insult to the concept of currency; yet, it constitutes the totality of my power over the material world. To read is to suspend the demand of the stomach; I must extract the universal from these particular cries before the sun climbs higher and the need for sustenance becomes a tyranny that I cannot philosophize away."}}],"created":1795128892,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":117,"prompt_tokens":178,"total_tokens":295,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-qXF3nQ43TZj6lEkoj1rFKDlQUSWfckC7","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":178,"prompt_ms":507.09,"prompt_per_token_ms":2.848820224719101,"prompt_per_second":351.0225009367174,"predicted_n":117,"predicted_ms":2845.836,"predicted_per_token_ms":24.533068965517238,"predicted_per_second":40.76130880345881}}